<p>Surround yourself with Uttercold, increasing all your cold damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2.5%, 5.0%, 6.9%, 8.6%, 10%</acronym> and ignoring <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">14%, 29%, 37%, 42%, 46%</acronym> cold resistance of your targets</p><p>In addition you pierce through iceblocks easily, reducing damage absorbed from your attacks by iceblocks by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20%, 40%, 60%, 80%, 100%.</acronym></p>